    "text": ":rocket: *Observability has arrived in OLake Go!*\nOLake Go now integrates seamlessly with *Prometheus*, giving you real-time visibility into your data pipelines with production-ready metrics for monitoring, dashboards, and alerting.\nGain deeper insights into pipeline health, track performance, and detect issues before they impact your workloads.\nGive it a try, and we’d love to hear your feedback! Please follow the documentation here: \u003chttps://olake.io/docs/monitoring-and-observability/metrics/|olake.io/docs/monitoring-and-observability/metrics\u003e",
    "ts": "1786453476.413889",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "fallback": "OLake: Prometheus Integration",
        "id": 1,
        "title": "Prometheus Integration",
        "title_link": "https://olake.io/docs/monitoring-and-observability/metrics/",
        "text": "Expose OLake Go sync and system metrics on a Prometheus-compatible `/metrics` endpoint for monitoring in Grafana and other tools.",
        "image_url": "https://olake.io/img/logo/olake-blue-with-text.webp",
        "image_bytes": 16350,
        "image_height": 530,
        "image_width": 1761,
